Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: apps/lib/cmp_mock_srv.c
Line: 346
Function: process_cert_request
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: Uses strcmp on data returned by ASN1_STRING_get0_data(str). ASN1_UTF8STRING buffers are not guaranteed to be NUL-terminated; strcmp may read past the end of the buffer. Triggered when a client supplies a certProfile ITAV with a non-NUL-terminated UTF8String.

